</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.4.7.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><span id="algorithm1.4.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"># Sort by cos similarity</span><span id="algorithm1.4.7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
